{
  "mode": 41,
  "title": "纯电流环 + 可选 dq 前馈实验（mode 29 加解耦前馈）",
  "entry": "comm_mode = 41",
  "pre": "必须先跑 mode 24（复用其零偏与偏移快照），否则 Start 拒绝启动",
  "end": "持续运行；仅过流自动停（state=2、evt=2），手动停写 comm_mode = 0",
  "watch": [
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_ff_enable",
      "val": "0",
      "unit": "-",
      "desc": "前馈总开关；0=mode29 基线"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_ff_bemf_gain",
      "val": "1.0",
      "unit": "-",
      "desc": "反电动势前馈增益"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_ff_cross_gain",
      "val": "1.0",
      "unit": "-",
      "desc": "交叉耦合增益；噪声最敏感"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_ff_res_gain",
      "val": "1.0",
      "unit": "-",
      "desc": "电阻项前馈增益"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_vmax_v",
      "val": "6.0",
      "unit": "V",
      "desc": "dq 合成电压限幅；0 = 不限"
    },
    {
      "mk": "(*)",
      "note": "前馈公式（ff_enable=1 时才生效）：vd_ff = -cross*omega*Ls*iq；vq_ff = cross*omega*Ls*id + bemf*omega*psi_f + res*Rs*iq_ref。系数取 FOC_MOTOR_LS_UH / FOC_MOTOR_FLUX_VS / FOC_MOTOR_RS_OHM。"
    },
    {
      "mk": "[!]",
      "note": "交叉项用实测 id/iq、BEMF 项用 200ms 窗速度、电阻项用 iq_ref：cross_gain 最容易把采样噪声灌进输出。"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_i_ref_ma",
      "val": "500",
      "unit": "mA",
      "desc": "电流矢量幅值参考"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_i_ramp_ma_s",
      "val": "0",
      "unit": "mA/s",
      "desc": "软启动斜率；<=0 直通"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_dlt_init_deg",
      "val": "90",
      "unit": "deg",
      "desc": "功角 delta 起点"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_dlt_targ_deg",
      "val": "90",
      "unit": "deg",
      "desc": "功角 delta 终点"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_dlt_tr_ms",
      "val": "0",
      "unit": "ms",
      "desc": "delta 爬坡时长；0 立即到位"
    },
    {
      "mk": "(*)",
      "note": "I_ref=500mA、delta=90 度时 id_ref=0、iq_ref=500mA（纯 q 轴）；改 delta 会同时改两个轴的参考。"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_iq_filt_alpha",
      "val": "0.10",
      "unit": "-",
      "desc": "iq 显示滤波；不进 PI"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_pid_id_cfg.kp",
      "val": "0.5",
      "unit": "V/A",
      "desc": "d 轴电流环 P"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_pid_iq_cfg.kp",
      "val": "0.5",
      "unit": "V/A",
      "desc": "q 轴电流环 P"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_pid_id_cfg.ki",
      "val": "300",
      "unit": "V/A/s",
      "desc": "d 轴电流环 I"
    },
    {
      "mk": "",
      "name": "g_drun41_pid_iq_cfg.ki",
      "val": "300",
      "unit": "V/A/s",
      "desc": "q 轴电流环 I"
    },
    {
      "mk": "[!]",
      "note": "前馈承担模型电压后可适当降 kp（0.15~0.25）、升 ki（300~400）：0.5 的 P 会把电流采样噪声较快映射到输出电压。kp/ki 每拍从 cfg 实时读取，Watch 改值立即生效（不用重进模式），但改 ki 不清积分，切增益后先看一段再判。"
    }
  ],
